# Story page: nightmaresdone
# {name} becomes the snake's name. Paragraphs are separated by a blank line.
title = Waking Up
---
{name} woke with a start, curled in the grass of a garden of no particular importance.

Every nightmare had been survived and every twist endured, and {name} felt enormous and ancient and slightly sticky.

'You are ready,' said the coil, from everywhere and nowhere at once. 'There is only one page left to write.'

Somewhere a blank page began to glow. I have been avoiding it for some time. I did not look up.
